.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt DEVICE_SHUTDOWN 9
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm device_shutdown
.Nd invoke shutdown callbacks across a device subtree
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In kern/device.h
.Ft void
.Fn device_shutdown "struct device *dev"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn device_shutdown
function walks a device subtree and invokes each bound driver's
.Va shutdown
callback.
.Pp
Children are shut down before their parent so downstream devices stop
accessing shared upstream transport state before the parent is torn down.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr device 9 ,
.Xr driver 9
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Fn device_shutdown
interface first appeared in Substrate.
